{"data": [{"author_id": "61542451", "created_at": "2026-11-03T05:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117483157201289652"], "id": "2117483157201289652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 137, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "央行十一月二号做了五千四百一十亿隔夜逆回购，利率一点二五，新日常隔夜框架落地。外场飞了二十年，燃油价一变你就得重算航程。你会先看短端资金松不松，还是等下周社融再说？", "url": "https://x.com/SicanianSun/status/2117483157201289652"}, {"author_id": "1791380668254994432", "created_at": "2026-11-04T16:18:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118014916481139100"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/LP0QY1zHp7", "end": 166, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Tiandao7777/status/2118014916481139100/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118014708577882113", "start": 143, "url": "https://t.co/LP0QY1zHp7"}, {"display_url": "x.com/Tiandao7777/st…", "end": 190, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Tiandao7777/status/2118012006561198311", "start": 167, "url": "https://t.co/DdyaxXIP6a"}]}, "id": "2118014916481139100", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 70, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118012006561198311", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "💥💥💥2018.08.05  郭文贵：中国人民银行副行长范一飞是个骗子，也是盗国贼集团的傀儡。\n\n💥💥💥2018.08.05  Miles Guo: Fan Yifei, VP of PBOC, is a swindler and puppet of the kleptocrats. https://t.co/LP0QY1zHp7 https://t.co/DdyaxXIP6a", "url": "https://x.com/Tiandao7777/status/2118014916481139100"}, {"author_id": "2108441099714834432", "created_at": "2026-11-04T15:16:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117999490690949215"], "id": "2117999490690949215", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "今天中国人民银行宣布：自11月4日起，股票回购增持再贷款利率下调0.25个百分点至1%，钱先给21家全国性银行和5家系统重要性城商行，名义是帮上市公司和大股东做市值管理。说白了，救市工具先救的是银行和上市公司的股价，普通家庭的房贷没松动、找工作的难处没松动、生活的开销没松动。散户在高位接盘、", "url": "https://x.com/qiuqiu23126/status/2117999490690949215"}, {"author_id": "2098323272152788992", "created_at": "2026-11-04T04:56:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117843279278686265"], "id": "2117843279278686265", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 206, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A股上涨的50个条件：\n1. 美股必须上涨。\n2. 韩股必须上涨。\n3. 日股必须上涨。\n4. 全球和平，俄乌、中东、半岛别出意外。\n5. 非洲和澳洲的矿产供应不能出问题。\n6. 特朗普不能乱说话。\n7. 美联储不能乱说话。\n8. 美国经济数据必须好看。\n9. 中国经济数据必须好看。\n10. 外资机构不能发负面观点。\n11.", "url": "https://x.com/mumacode/status/2117843279278686265"}, {"author_id": "365568403", "created_at": "2026-11-03T11:21:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117577911251456497"], "id": "2117577911251456497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 227, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "金融顶层政策明确五大工作安排，资本市场迎中长期支撑\n\n【政策速递】\n\n11月3日，国务院关于金融工作情况的报告提请十四届全国人大常委会第二十五次会议审议。报告明确了我国金融工作下一阶段的五大重点安排，释放出持续支持实体经济与资本市场平稳发展的信号。\n\n【核心数据解读】", "url": "https://x.com/eakts/status/2117577911251456497"}, {"author_id": "1481937215496372233", "created_at": "2026-11-03T10:41:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117567871949693056"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/TDbkL24Fh7", "end": 82, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/RostovRambo/status/2117567871949693056/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117567864739663872", "start": 59, "url": "https://t.co/TDbkL24Fh7"}]}, "id": "2117567871949693056", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 1191, "like_count": 67, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 3}, "text": "The people\nLPR&gt;DPR\n\nWhere I'd rather fight? \nDPR&gt;LPR https://t.co/TDbkL24Fh7", "url": "https://x.com/RostovRambo/status/2117567871949693056"}, {"author_id": "784914790112165888", "created_at": "2026-11-03T22:33:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117747095725846972"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/icegov/status/…", "end": 169, "expanded_url":